# Teleportation of qubit 0 (psi = |0>) to qubit 2
# 3 qubits: 0 = state to teleport, 1+2 = quantum channel
3
# Create Bell pair on qubits 1 and 2
H 1
CNOT 1 2
# Bell measurement on qubits 0 and 1
CNOT 0 1
H 0
MEASURE 0
MEASURE 1
# Corrections on qubit 2 based on the measurement outcomes
CX 1 2
CZ 0 2
